## What it is

A squad-based hero shooter with distinctive character abilities and battle royale competition.

## Is this your kind of game?

Choose this if coordinated squad play and learning character abilities appeal to you. Watch an ordinary match sequence to understand the pace between encounters, rather than judging only a highlight reel.

## Download and purchase

The base game is listed as free to play; optional purchases may be available. Use the official Steam button on this page to open the publisher's listing. Installation is handled by Steam; GameNews does not host installers or game files.

The Steam listing identifies an EA account requirement. Review its current account and installation conditions before starting the download.

## Before installing

Compare your operating system, processor, memory, graphics support, and available storage with the complete current requirements. A minimum specification is not a promise of a particular frame rate on your computer. Leave room for updates and check any additional account requirements before downloading.

## Sources and editorial basis

Product information checked against the [official Steam listing](https://store.steampowered.com/app/1172470/?l=english) on 16 October 2026. Selected with reference to [Steam's most-played chart](https://store.steampowered.com/charts/mostplayed/). This is a researched profile, not a hands-on review or a search-volume ranking. Live prices, player counts, and performance scores are intentionally not quoted.
